sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  participant UI as Django Checkout Route
  participant C as CheckoutService
  participant S as Pricing Strategy
  participant B as OrderDraft Builder
  participant I as Inventory Port
  participant O as Order/State
  participant DB as SQLite + Outbox
  participant W as Async Observer Worker
  Customer->>UI: Checkout
  UI->>C: place_order()
  C->>S: calculate_discount()
  S-->>C: discount
  C->>B: build validated draft
  B-->>C: OrderDraft
  C->>I: reserve atomically
  C->>O: transition order state
  C->>DB: commit order + reservation + outbox
  C-->>UI: accepted
  UI-->>Customer: order confirmation
  W->>DB: poll committed outbox
  W->>W: notify subscribed handlers
  W->>DB: record per-handler outcome
